      <div class="hero-shade"></div>
      <div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">HUAHAI PHOTO STUDIO</span><h1 id="hero-title">把此刻，<br />留给时光。</h1><p>用镜头记录真实的情绪，让每一个值得珍藏的瞬间都有温度。</p><div class="hero-actions"><el-button class="studio-primary" @click="go('sheyingshixinxiList')">寻找摄影师 ↗</el-button><el-button class="studio-outline" @click="go('sheyingzuopinList')">浏览作品</el-button></div><span class="hero-note">花海摄影工作室 · 与你一起发现生活的美</span></div>
    </section>
